# Built deck output is committed on purpose, so that the deck opens from a
# fresh clone with nothing installed. Nothing to ignore here.

# Per-event branding. The framework is the artifact; the event is supplemental.
# A host's logo is their trademark and is not redistributable under Apache 2.0.
deck/host.json
deck/assets/host-*
deck/assets/*GSDC*
deck/assets/*gsdc*
